# Runtime data
data/news.db
data/news.db-wal
data/news.db-shm
data/transcripts.db
data/transcripts.db-wal
data/transcripts.db-shm
data/news.db.*
# Includes the harvester's IP-block cooldown state file, transcripts.db.cooldown.
data/transcripts.db.*
# ...and the DOTTED temp variant, which `data/news.db.*` does not match: sqlite
# and the sync path write `data/.news.db.<random>` (plus -wal/-shm siblings) and
# rename over the real file. Caught one at 560 MB and still growing on
# 2026-09-20; `git check-ignore` said NOT IGNORED, and this repo is public, so it
# was one `git add -A` away from a 1.3 GB private corpus in a public history.
# Same shape as the `.env` / `.env.bak-*` gap recorded in sw-utils: an exact-path
# ignore that the tool's own temp naming walks straight around.
data/.news.db*
data/.transcripts.db*
data/run.log
data/runs.log
data/archive/
data/*.lock
data/*.err
data/*.log
data/llm_trace.jsonl

